  "post_content": "<p style=\"text-align: center; \"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2011/06/El-Mercadito.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 350px; \" /></p><p><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; \">La Asociaci&oacute;n Ecol&oacute;gica <em>El Mercadito</em>, recientemente creada, invita a todos sus&nbsp;</span><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; \">asociados y simpatizantes a participar en su primera reuni&oacute;n informativa, donde dar&aacute;n inicio&nbsp;</span><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; \">a este proyecto, compartiendo una degustaci&oacute;n de los&nbsp;</span><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; \">productos que formar&aacute;n parte de su mesa diaria. La cita ser&aacute; en el&nbsp;</span><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; \">Casal Jove&nbsp;</span><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; \">el jueves 9 de junio, a las 19:00 horas.</span></p>"
